MACRO 1 PREF WORK '*' PROC '*'                                                  
* *                                                                             
* *    W W D I S 1 0 6                                                          
* *                                                                             
* *        TEST AV DISTRIKT                                                     
* *                                                                             
* *    U S A G E :                                                              
* *                                                                             
* *        THIS COPYTEXT IS A DUAL-PURPOSE COPYTEXT. IF COULD BE USED           
* *    JUST TO DEFINE DISTRICT CONSTANTS, AND/OR COULD BE USED AS A             
* *    PROCEDURE TO CHECK DISTRICT GROUPS.                                      
* *        IF THIS COPYTEXT IS NEEDED IN EPLUST PROGRAM, THEN THERE             
* *    MUST BE ATLEAST ONE DEFINITION IN THE WORKING STORAGE  AREA,LIKE         
* *    THIS...                                                                  
* *              %WWDIS106  REQUIRED-PREFIX  WORK ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *        IF DISTRICT GROUPS ARE TO BE TESTED, THE COPYTEXT HAS TO BE          
* *     AS ...                                                                  
* *              %WWDIS106  REQUIRED-PREFIX  PROC ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *     AT THE END OF THE JOB AND THE PROCEDURE IN THE COPYTEXT CAN BE          
* *     CALLED FROM ANYWHERE IN THE JOB LIKE...                                 
* *                                                                             
* *              PERFORM S75-TEST-DIS106                                        
* *                                                                             
* *     I M P O R T A N T :                                                     
* *                                                                             
* *       - WHEN DEFINING NEW FIELDS IN THIS COPYTEXT,THE &&WORK FIELD          
* *         MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                                           
* *       - WHEN ADDING NEW DISTRICT GROUP PROCEDURES TO THIS COPYTEXT,         
* *         THE &&PROC FIELD MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                          
* *       - WHEN ANY CHANGES ARE DONE, ALL THE EPLUS PROGRAMS THAT USE          
* *         THIS COPYTEXT MUST BE RECOMPILED.                                   
* *                                                                             
* *     E R R O R S :                                                           
* *                                                                             
* *       IN CASE OF ANY COMPILATATION ERRORS, PLEASE CHECK IF THE              
* *     CORRECT VALUES ARE PASSED TO THE &&WORK AND &&PREF PARAMETERS.          
* *     THE ONLY VALID VALUE FOR THESE PARAMETERS ARE ''.                       
* *                                                                             
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  DISTRICT CONSTANT DEFINITIONS.                                             
* *                                                                             
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-TOTALLISTA     W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-ITAL           W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-ENGLAND        W 5 N VALUE 1378                      
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-ISRAEL         W 5 N VALUE 5120                      
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-AUSTRIA        W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-FIN            W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-JAPAN          W 5 N VALUE 5220                      
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-HOLLAND        W 5 N VALUE 1678                      
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-TYSKL          W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-FRANK          W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-NORGE          W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-SPANIEN        W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-SCHWEIZ        W 5 N VALUE 0                         
&WORK DEFINE DIS106-ROINFO-BRASIL         W 5 N VALUE 7070                      
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  DISTRICT GROUP TESTING PROCEDURES.                                         
* *                                                                             
&PROC.S75-TEST-DIS106. PROC                                                     
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR EQ 2614 2621 2622 2624                 +                 
&PROC                     2626 2636 2643 2647                 +                 
&PROC                     2648 2653                           +                 
&PROC                     2661 2662 2667 2671                 +                 
&PROC                     2673 2677 2678 2679                 +                 
&PROC                     3130 3235 3660                      +                 
&PROC                     3670 4400 4834 5310                 +                 
&PROC                     5415 5625 5725 5735                 +                 
&PROC                     5827 5840 6121                      +                 
&PROC                     6231 6236 6585 7412                 +                 
&PROC                     7496 7538                                             
&PROC    DIS106-ROINFO-TOTALLISTA = &PREF.IDDISTR                               
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  1820 THRU 1829 +                                      
&PROC                     1831 THRU 1833 +                                      
&PROC                     1835 THRU 1883                                        
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-ITAL = &PREF.IDDISTR                                      
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  2346 2334                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-AUSTRIA = &PREF.IDDISTR                                   
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  2270 2278                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-TYSKL = &PREF.IDDISTR                                     
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  1470 1478                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-FRANK = &PREF.IDDISTR                                     
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  1000 1090                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-FIN    = &PREF.IDDISTR                                    
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  0870 0878                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-NORGE = &PREF.IDDISTR                                     
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  2170 2174 2178                                        
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-SPANIEN = &PREF.IDDISTR                                   
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR =  2070 2078                                             
&PROC   DIS106-ROINFO-SCHWEIZ = &PREF.IDDISTR                                   
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC.END-PROC                                                                  
MEND                                                                            
